"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"if57kE6_VfR1nI1X93oHEA","review_id":"dPxgaS1hx5ZZfWLLqFtoQA","date":"2018-04-23T00:28:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9313561916351318,"text_excerpt":"Wifey and I stopped in for an appetizer and ended up getting an app, entree and dessert. The Brussel sprouts were delicious. They were chewier than expected, but the bacon and butter sauce was rich and mmm, mmm good. Next we shared the broiled gulf fish, which was drum. It came with grilled asparagus and Brabant potatoes. All very good. I just wish the potatoes had been crispier like the ones Kenton's used to make. We finished with the chocolate ganache cake. It was so moist and chocolaty. It really hit the spot. Service was great. Our server was fast and very attentive. Ambiance was also great. It's a beautiful restaurant and great place to watch a game or for a date night. The only nega..."},{"business_id":"if57kE6_VfR1nI1X93oHEA","review_id":"kSQKXVujgBFYEsG7-5VE-g","date":"2018-02-16T20:58:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.927610456943512,"text_excerpt":"I don't even know how we ended up at Sala but my fiancé was impressed. He was ooing and ahhing at the modern furniture and fancy decor. I liked it too. I really wish Sala had a deal on unlimited mimosas (and/or screw drivers) because if they did, I would definitely be here every weekend for brunch. Our food was delish. My favorite was the side of truffle fries. The aioli was sooooo good. No complaints on this place. I loved it."},{"business_id":"if57kE6_VfR1nI1X93oHEA","review_id":"ZfnNbmFbbu0YMDAFs8ZKZw","date":"2021-06-18T15:20:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9252929091453552,"text_excerpt":"Treated myself to a \"self care Saturday\" and this is where I decided to eat after looking through reviews. I sat at the bar and was taken care of by Woody (pretty cool guy). I began my dining experience with a glass of Prosecco and the crawfish bisque for an appetizer. Both were superb! For an entree, I had the Gulf Fish Beurre Blanc which was just \"ok\". The fish was pretty bland, but the sauce gave it some much needed flavor. I let Woody talk me into getting dessert as well (not pictured). I highly recommend the Zeppole! Omg, soooo good and perfectly textured. The warm icing is what won me over."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"if57kE6_VfR1nI1X93oHEA","photo_id":"L5xI5sD2kJ-0hhr4rxWzbw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/L5xI5sD2kJ-0hhr4rxWzbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9030930399894714},{"business_id":"if57kE6_VfR1nI1X93oHEA","photo_id":"-hLH9ZHSb_9CCZ-wDZfFzA","label":"drink","image_url"